    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize math learning by adapting to individual student needs through interactive problem-solving. They can generate step-by-step explanations, provide instant feedback, and create engaging scenarios that connect math to real-world contexts like biology or environmental science."
